# Kind $20's guard spotting Aladdin, charging and halting on crafted
# ground, on the first level with the guard at record $0BAB (x $0125,
# y $01B0, by the block at x $0130), the camera put at x $0080. The map
# cells poked are level tile words at $7F0000: $1140 an empty tile, $27A8
# a tile of kind $0F (behaviour $84: low bits 4), which this level's map
# has none of.
# 1. Its place byte $07 given bit 4 (it sees past the map), Aladdin at
#    x $0170 beyond the block: it turns to him with the block ahead and
#    halts at once (Kind20Spotted, $83:98B3).
# 2. A pit 48 pixels wide in the floor (x $00C0-$00EF, the floor row at
#    y $01C0 emptied), $07 = $0B (bit 3, the faster charge) and Aladdin at
#    x $00A0: it charges at speed $80 ($83:98EA), runs off the pit's edge
#    with the floor below further on ($83:992D, its fall at $83:997C),
#    and at the pit's far side, the wall with nothing above it, leaps
#    ($83:9944, $83:996C); at the block at x $0060 it halts.
# 3. A kind $0F tile in the floor at x $0100 on its beat: walking over it
#    it takes the ledge's probe ($83:9812, ActorMapAhead7Down36 $83:9A11).
# 4. The same tile, the floor just left of it (x $00F0, rows $01C0 and
#    $01D0) emptied, and Aladdin at x $00A0: charging over the tile, the
#    ledge's probe finds nothing below ($83:9911).
load build/aladdin/states/level1.state
wait 30
poke 001773 80,00
poke 0019E5 80,00
poke 000BB2 13
poke 0008E7 70,01
poke 0008EA B0,01
wait 60
load build/aladdin/states/level1.state
wait 30
poke 001773 80,00
poke 0019E5 80,00
poke 7F2198 40,11
poke 7F219A 40,11
poke 7F219C 40,11
poke 000BB2 0B
poke 0008E7 A0,00
poke 0008EA B0,01
wait 200
load build/aladdin/states/level1.state
wait 30
poke 7F2380 A8,27
wait 200
load build/aladdin/states/level1.state
wait 30
poke 001773 80,00
poke 0019E5 80,00
poke 7F2380 A8,27
poke 7F219E 40,11
poke 7F21BE 40,11
poke 0008E7 A0,00
poke 0008EA B0,01
wait 200
